// PARAM: --analysis sign
// An assignment to an unrelated name must not perturb what is already known
// about another: y := 1 sits between x := 5 and the check on x, and x stays
// exactly SPos. No call, no global, no widening -- so this pins the transfer
// layer itself rather than a report readback. unit_step_st computes
// f (combine_resolved_st_q d g) and only then splits the result back into
// local/global halves, routing each name to the exec state that owns it
// instead of joining it against the other half's unrelated Top default.
//
// 03-global_write_across_call.vimp is the same property with real
// interprocedural machinery in play; this is the isolated version.

void main() {
  x := 5;
  y := 1;
  __voblint_check(0 < x) // PROVED
}
